[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2917023832","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106840#issuecomment-2917023832","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106840","id":2917023832,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t3kBY","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T17:01:32Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T17:01:32Z","body":"Confirmed reproduced on v4.5.dev.custom_build [c3ae6aa10], Linux Mint X11.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2917023832/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918487287","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106840#issuecomment-2918487287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106840","id":2918487287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t9JT3","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T06:50:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T19:54:00Z","body":"![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10afce97-e278-4207-b97f-934b765e3e12)\n\nAfter some digging, the issue seems to originate from \n`script->get_language()->lookup_code(code_text, p_symbol, script->get_path(), base, result)` \nat line 1370 in `script_text_editor.cpp`. \n\nManual trace: \n1. Incorrect `if-else` order in `script->get_language()->lookup_code()`\n2. Incorrect `result.class_name` in `ScriptTextEditor::_show_symbol_tooltip()`\n3. Incorrect `doc_symbol` in `ScriptTextEditor::_show_symbol_tooltip()`\n4. Incorrect argument in `EditorHelpBitTooltip::show_tooltip( &p_symbol = doc_symbol )`\n6. Incorrect argument in `EditorHelpBit( &p_symbol = p_symbol )`\n7. Incorrect argument in `parse_symbol( &p_symbol = p_symbol )` <-- where I started","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918487287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2920404953","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106840#issuecomment-2920404953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106840","id":2920404953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uEdfZ","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T19:43:40Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T00:55:23Z","body":"Potential Fix: \n\nMove this code in `gdscript_editor.cpp` from line 4272 to line 4348. \n```\nif (_lookup_symbol_from_base(base_type, p_symbol, r_result) == OK) {\n    return OK;\n}\n```\ni.e. Insert it after\n```\nif (Variant::has_utility_function(p_symbol)) {\n    r_result.type = ScriptLanguage::LOOKUP_RESULT_CLASS_METHOD;\n    r_result.class_name = \"@GlobalScope\";\n    r_result.class_member = p_symbol;\n    return OK;\n}\n```\n\nThis resolves the inconsistency between the GDScript editor tooltip showing the local method and the script calling the `@GlobalScope` method. \n\nI assume this is the intended behaviour, as global methods have a purple colour, and local methods have a blue colour (in both Godot 4.1.1 stable and master). \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df3a0c68-780d-43cb-9600-600119d79930)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17707ed0-e141-4c3a-b9a0-eb7fec320735)\n\nAs to whether local methods should instead hide global methods (i.e. change the GDScript execution behaviour), should I open a Godot Proposal? \n\nI can open a pull request if only the above changes are needed. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2920404953/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]